                "text": "Recently, I was featured on DC News Now to discuss my journey with kidney disease. Often times, early stages show no symptoms. That\u2019s why getting early screening is crucial. A simple test can save your kidneys and your life. \ud83d\udc9a\n I am honored to join the @americankidneyfund this Saturday at University of Maryland Capitol Region Medical Center at 12 p.m. to spread the word this #KidneyAwarenessMonth. #EarlyScreening #KidneyHealth",
